# fixture: new game spawn and the onFrame intro message.
# Timings (real World/VM, 30 Hz): the map fades in over 8 ticks, then the onFrame row fires; text
# prints 1 char per 2 ticks ("Morning light fills the room." waits for input at tick 70).
0 assert map fixture:ROOM
0 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 16
0 assert flag fixture:FLAG_NEW_GAME_DONE true
0 assert var fixture:VAR_ROOM_INTRO 0
8 assert message closed
12 assert message open
12 assert var fixture:VAR_ROOM_INTRO 1
# the script locks the player: holding a direction does not walk
20 press left
24 release left
40 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 16
80 assert message open
80 press a
82 release a
86 assert message closed
# the intro does not run again (VAR_ROOM_INTRO is 1); the player is free to move
90 press up
92 release up
100 assert position fixture:ROOM 14 15
